                <head>[Inclosure 2.]</head>
                <p>Inclosure 2 being award of the commission of arbitration under the provisions of
                    the protocol of January 31, 1903, between the United States of America and the
                    Domincan Republic, for the settlement of the claims of the San Domingo
                    Improvement Company of New York, and its allied companies, printed <ref
                        target="frus:frus1904/pg_274">Foreign Relations, 1904, p. 274</ref>.</p>
            </div>
